OL,3,GNEWSATeenager seriously injured in
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has suffered serious
OL,7,Finjuries after he was stabbed in the
OL,8,Fchest in Leamington Spa.
OL,10,FWarwickshire Police said the incident
OL,11,Fhappened near the bandstand in the Pump
OL,12,FRoom Gardens, at about 22:25 BST on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FA 16-year-old boy has been arrested on
OL,16,Fsuspicion of affray, officers said, and
OL,17,Finquiries are ongoing to identify and
OL,18,Flocate the person responsible for the
OL,19,Fstabbing.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
